### Negative control for the OWL 2 DL profile check in `make reasoner`: a
### datatype property (martialis:quotation) used with an IRI value, which makes
### OWLAPI read it as an object property too - a pun OWL 2 DL forbids. If the
### profile check stops rejecting it, the step fails.

@prefix martialis: <https://w3id.org/martialis/ontology#> .

<https://martial.is/entity/control-evidence> martialis:quotation <https://example.org/not-a-literal> .
